.TH FCR 1 "September 2026" "fcr" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
fcr \- concatenate files and print on the standart output.

.SH SYNOPSIS
.RI fcr [OPTION]

.SH DESCRIPTION
concatenate files and print on the standart output.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-n
Number all output lines.

.TP
.BR \-b
Number only nonempty output lines.

.TP
.BR \-e
Show end of each line by printing $ sign

.SH AUTHOR
Written as C++ implementation of the Linux cat command.